              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose waghamba, “Nasikire madukano gha Moabu na masholio gha Waamoni, seji wiwidukanire wandu wapo, na kukukasa aighu ya isanga jawo.",
