          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchawuya andu kolishira, na nyamandu rose ra kula kichuku richakaia aho. Mkungi ghuchakaia a maghachonyi ghukibora aidirishenyi, na ngorusa avizingitinyi va mnyango; kazi yose ya mudi ghwa sida ibonyero ichainjwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho nigho ghichaaghupata muzi ghukukasire kwa ndighi rake, na wandu waro kughamba niwo wabaa wurumwengunyi. Ghuchasighwa mduu, na nyamandu richakaia aho. Kula mundu uidagha aho uchashinika na kusughusa chongo chake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
